{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:10.60.550","page_type":"section"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"b3f6bccdfec3a8e9fff6cb98339f7a99b9fe1389085c41c3a48c3508d30de4a1","heading":"Violation notices – Contents, distribution and record keeping.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(a) The violation notice shall state the following information:\n(1) The parking ordinance allegedly violated;\n(2) The make and license tag number of the cited vehicle;\n(3) The place, date, and time of the alleged violation;\n(4) The identification number of the ticketing agent.\nIn addition, the parking violation notice shall state the applicable fine, the monetary penalty which shall be automatically assessed for late payment, that payment of the indicated fine, and any applicable penalty shall operate as a final disposition of the violation, and information about the availability of an administrative hearing in which the violation may be contested on its merits and the time and manner in which such hearing may be had.\n(b) The City Traffic Compliance Administrator shall distribute parking violation notices to persons authorized to issue parking violation notices and the Police Department. The Police Chief shall be responsible for the distribution of the notice forms within the Police Department.\n(c) The City Traffic Compliance Administrator shall compile and maintain complete and accurate records relating to all parking violation notices issued and the dispositions thereof. (Ord. 17636 § 4, 1-9-01. Code 1995 § 142-519.)\nCross References: Police Department, TMC 2.20.090 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"2d0a23f2-ba19-5d6b-94d4-9148b7904b4d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"dcaf78831dc3a9a2db823cf6fc87524adafb24650740e89ed2512c38ab8fb513","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(a) The violation notice shall state the following information:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"198b0726-7ce2-50a4-93b0-affce7f3396d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"4f23b59a583a358aec93875708bac180e401a8f4e8798a8aacf149de344f6669","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(1) The parking ordinance allegedly violated;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"a68106d4-8ad4-586d-8fb9-628847667b4d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"ac0520d43e513200ec4ce59441833d15bb95a273d62982788363e2085a614cc1","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(2) The make and license tag number of the cited vehicle;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"19fd1a50-e43d-597a-9732-662cea51d79a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"d3536e3b868d5185b9711c820bdc7fde193148522a19d61c535105cf15676c50","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(3) The place, date, and time of the alleged violation;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"7e1dfd4c-3a34-515f-9687-c24c2fac1698"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"8088df5e612de80092758b7afb5982de1f1022a07fc4bd8853a560d48c7c3254","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(4) The identification number of the ticketing agent.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b6babeb1-f2b5-52ef-930d-218ab27252e4"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"0db60cc1286548d28c161d089e2b5c66486265ccb15ce5ccf16f69a0653f6e9a","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"In addition, the parking violation notice shall state the applicable fine, the monetary penalty which shall be automatically assessed for late payment, that payment of the indicated fine, and any applicable penalty shall operate as a final disposition of the violation, and information about the availability of an administrative hearing in which the violation may be contested on its merits and the time and manner in which such hearing may be had.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"2f7e74a0-e3ee-59f7-9ebc-a0413fd5c806"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"de1a173be261c7996fe18c94e91b337d95c627dc7156760c0aa9ef4650a6e450","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(b) The City Traffic Compliance Administrator shall distribute parking violation notices to persons authorized to issue parking violation notices and the Police Department. The Police Chief shall be responsible for the distribution of the notice forms within the Police Department.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"612bbf55-9ed5-5040-8dce-ccd6a79e9ef3"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.60.550","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","content_hash":"030936fb01408eb9634407498304b982349ca73ea9a3f60161f674c9e0a2ff2c","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.60.550:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.60.550","text":"(c) The City Traffic Compliance Administrator shall compile and maintain complete and accurate records relating to all parking violation notices issued and the dispositions thereof. (Ord. 17636 § 4, 1-9-01. Code 1995 § 142-519.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"889c6033-